289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2025-05-16T20:09:16Z","updated_at":"2025-05-20T11:16:15Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Godot v4.4.1.stable (49a5bc7b6)\n- Godot v4.5-dev4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.1.stable (49a5bc7b6) - Freedesktop SDK 24.08 (Flatpak runtime) on Wayland - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (RADV NAVI31) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K (20 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nPhysics spaces (\"islands\") created via `PhysicsServer3D.space_create()` are never freed when using **Jolt Physics**. This causes high memory usage aswell as high CPU usage (any physics bodies inside these spaces are still simulated).\nThis problem does not occur when using **GodotPhysics3D**.\n\nCombined with the lack of a PhysicsServer3D method to deallocate/free a space, this issue means that everytime I reload my scene, my game runs a little slower and uses more memory, until performance eventually degrates to the point where it is no longer playable.\n\n---\n\n### Example\n\n(Rapidly) reloading my scene using **GodotPhysics3D**:\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8fc60237-2163-4ae7-ba52-a163c615480f\n\n(Rapidly) reloading my scene using **Jolt Physics**:\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ee556cf0-e5f1-4b4d-b4d3-dd542b215b33\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Start the MRP (`physics/3d/physics_engine` is set to **GodotPhysics3D**)\n- Run the main scene\n- Observe the static memory under \"Monitors\" (in my testing around 53MB)\n- Change the project setting `physics/3d/physics_engine` to **Jolt Physics** and restart\n- Run the main scene again\n- Observe the static memory again (in my testing around **3.2GB**)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[physics_spaces_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20258710/physics_spaces_mrp.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106506/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106506/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}